:3708866711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dENCX","user":{"login":"unixfan2","id":152319902,"node_id":"U_kgDOCRQ3ng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152319902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2","html_url":"https://github.com/unixfan2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-05T04:04:52Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T04:04:52Z","body":"I want to run several checks before i open an PR:\n1. What to do with the half_res and quarter_res? They are maybe completely invalid in compatibility?\n2. I guess there is more. On the PC setup, my fix is working, but on Meta Quest 3, it is not working (although the cubemap is obviously generated). I'm currently investigating if the resulting GLSL has also additional issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3708866711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3711449129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114606#issuecomment-3711449129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114606","id":3711449129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dODgp","user":{"login":"unixfan2","id":152319902,"node_id":"U_kgDOCRQ3ng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152319902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2","html_url":"https://github.com/unixfan2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unixfan2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-05T17:45:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T17:45:20Z","body":"I just forgot to rebuild my android templates -- it also works on Meta Quest 3.\nSo the only question left is: Should I\n1. keep half and quarter res at it is with obviously wrong texunits?\n2. delete them (I guess they have no meaning anyway in compability, but i'm not sure)?\n3. shift the texunits?\n```\nuniform samplerCube radiance; //texunit:-2\n#ifdef USE_CUBEMAP_PASS\nuniform samplerCube half_res; //texunit:-2\nuniform samplerCube quarter_res; //texunit:-3\n#elif defined(USE_MULTIVIEW)\nuniform sampler2DArray half_res; //texunit:-2\nuniform sampler2DArray quarter_res; //texunit:-3\n#else\nuniform sampler2D half_res; //texunit:-2\nuniform sampler2D quarter_res; //texunit:-3\n#endif\n```\n\nCurrent fix (only change texunit for radiance):\n```\ndiff --git a/drivers/gles3/shaders/sky.glsl b/drivers/gles3/shaders/sky.glsl\nindex dd0bd7962e..f2dd97e97d 100644\n--- a/drivers/gles3/shaders/sky.glsl\n+++ b/drivers/gles3/shaders/sky.glsl\n@@ -40,7 +40,7 @@ in vec2 uv_interp;\n \n /* clang-format on */\n \n-uniform samplerCube radiance; //texunit:-1\n+uniform samplerCube radiance; //texunit:-2\n #ifdef USE_CUBEMAP_PASS\n uniform samplerCube half_res; //texunit:-2\n uniform samplerCube quarter_res; //texunit:-3\n\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3711449129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]